# indiamart (export)

- **Method:** Marketplace (B2B, India) — many independent sellers
- **Currency:** USD / INR (per seller)
- **Shipping:** ~**$50 flat/order** (Jigar Healthcare confirmed) — **batch everything into one order**
- **Payment / Fees:** per-seller (bank/escrow); + import duty + FX · **No MOQ**
- **Use:** generic + branded ancillaries (Metformin, SGLT2, statins, ARB, β-blocker, T4) — buy any quantity.

**Confirmed sellers:** Shree DKR (Jardiance) · Gannon Medex (Glycomet) · **Jigar Healthcare (Nebivolol $30/box, Glucophage $35/box)** · Dev Impex (Telmisartan) · Martin Overseas (Memantine, Ezetimibe) · GS Associates (Rosuvastatin).

> [!note] Channel, not one vendor. Each listing is a different seller. The $50 ship is per-order, so consolidate the whole year's ancillaries into a single Jigar/multi-seller order to amortize it.

